           alt  0.00       0.548  0.037    0.514 |       +0.9s       -1.7s       -5.2s       -7.3s | -0.062 / -0.028  BOTH EMPTY
           alt  0.10       0.693  0.040    0.659 |       -2.7s       -5.1s       -8.3s      -10.3s | -0.207 / -0.173  BOTH EMPTY
           alt  0.20       0.873  0.045    0.841 |       -6.5s       -8.7s      -11.6s      -13.4s | -0.387 / -0.355  BOTH EMPTY
